WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,610
Sitting at the door, lying down and sucking blood

2
00:00:01,610 --> 00:00:02,570
Simply

3
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:04,250
Two to three thousand people come and go every day

4
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:05,570
Like thousands of gold coins every day

5
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,610
So hateful

6
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:14,280
Those bandits who charge protection fees

7
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,440
How many people are there in total?

8
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,000
It was too dark to see clearly

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,640
But there must be hundreds

10
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,080
If Brother Xu hadn’t been attacked

11
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,280
will never die

12
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,240
These guys take action whenever they disagree.

13
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,200
From now on Zhu Xiaojun

14
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,400
How can you afford to pay a gold coin?

15
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,720
A dozen of the nine-level battle calendars were damaged this time

16
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,080
I can't resist even if I want to.

17
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,190
they also said

18
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:33,790
Collect protection fees door to door

19
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:35,680
Just crazy

20
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:41,390
It would be great if you could lead us to kill those bastards.

21
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,590
Classmate Chen An

22
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:44,590
Can you take us in?

23
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:48,620
Originally, Lu Xi and I could have three children.

24
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:51,300
But I was forcibly defrauded of two gold coins just now.

25
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,960
Now I only have two gold coins left in my hand.
